   EDIT HERE — everything on the site comes from this one block.
   Videos: use a YouTube/Vimeo EMBED link ("https://www.youtube.com/embed/ID")
           OR your own file ("videos/my-reel.mp4"). Same for preview/thumb/images.
   Leave any value as "" to hide it or show a placeholder.
   ===================================================================== */
const SITE={
  name:"Your Name",
  role:"Filmmaker · Motion Designer · Editor",
